  "plain": "A guest named Merrick von Renenamp says on a podcast that Jon Kosloski, a Pentagon official tied to AARO (the office set up to look into unexplained flying objects), said at a 2024 hearing with Senator Kirsten Gillibrand that at least two firsthand witnesses had come to that office. According to Merrick, these witnesses spoke of secret programmes about such objects that had not been reported to Congress, which if true would mean hidden programmes exist."
